	<entry>
		<title>Update: Jonas Akerlund is now directing Madonna Turn Up The Radio video. And Tom Munro?</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/779-update-jonas-akerlund-is-now-directing-madonna-turn-up-the-radio-video-and-tom-munro?.html"/>
		<published>2012-06-16T10:15:35Z</published>
		<updated>2012-06-16T10:15:35Z</updated>
		<id>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/779-update-jonas-akerlund-is-now-directing-madonna-turn-up-the-radio-video-and-tom-munro?.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Giampiero Fiorelli</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;EXCLUSIVE - When &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/776-exclusive-tom-munro-to-direct-madonnas-turn-up-the-radio-video.html&quot;&gt;we revealed that Tom Munro&lt;/a&gt; was the director of &lt;strong&gt;Madonna's Turn Up The Radio video&lt;/strong&gt;, we omitted to report that &lt;strong&gt;Jonas Akerlund&lt;/strong&gt; was the director at first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now we have learned that &lt;strong&gt;Jonas Akerlund&lt;/strong&gt; is directed the music video for &lt;strong&gt;Turn Up The Radio&lt;/strong&gt;, which is still planned for this weekend in Florence, if it is not going to be postponed again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anyway, keep in mind that we cannot exclude that there will be a last minute change again and &lt;strong&gt;Tom Munro&lt;/strong&gt; is back on the project.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Akerlund&lt;/strong&gt; directed &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;'s videos for Ray of Light, Music, American Life and Jump. He also directed I'm Going to Tell You a Secret documentary and her Confessions Tour DVD.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
		<content type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;EXCLUSIVE - When &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/776-exclusive-tom-munro-to-direct-madonnas-turn-up-the-radio-video.html&quot;&gt;we revealed that Tom Munro&lt;/a&gt; was the director of &lt;strong&gt;Madonna's Turn Up The Radio video&lt;/strong&gt;, we omitted to report that &lt;strong&gt;Jonas Akerlund&lt;/strong&gt; was the director at first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now we have learned that &lt;strong&gt;Jonas Akerlund&lt;/strong&gt; is directed the music video for &lt;strong&gt;Turn Up The Radio&lt;/strong&gt;, which is still planned for this weekend in Florence, if it is not going to be postponed again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anyway, keep in mind that we cannot exclude that there will be a last minute change again and &lt;strong&gt;Tom Munro&lt;/strong&gt; is back on the project.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Akerlund&lt;/strong&gt; directed &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;'s videos for Ray of Light, Music, American Life and Jump. He also directed I'm Going to Tell You a Secret documentary and her Confessions Tour DVD.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content>
	</entry>
