	<entry>
		<title>Madonna Turn Up The Radio video shooting directed by Tom Munro is postponed</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/777-madonna-turn-up-the-radio-video-shooting-directed-by-tom-munro-is-postponed.html"/>
		<published>2012-06-10T13:25:29Z</published>
		<updated>2012-06-10T13:25:29Z</updated>
		<id>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/777-madonna-turn-up-the-radio-video-shooting-directed-by-tom-munro-is-postponed.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Giampiero Fiorelli</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;They are still not ready for the shooting of &lt;strong&gt;Turn Up The Radio&lt;/strong&gt;, therefore it is not taking place today as previously planned, reported and also confirmed by Live Nation Italia. They are still looking for a product placement deal, especially an automotive deal,  like Madonna did with Smirnoff in Give Me All Your Luvin' video and Jennifer Lopez had with FIAT in her  Papi video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maybe, the video shooting - directed by &lt;strong&gt;Tom Munro&lt;/strong&gt; as we told you a few days ago - will happen next weekend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports by Italian press regarding archeological areas in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt; were not true, in fact a car theme was part of the concept.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
		<content type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;They are still not ready for the shooting of &lt;strong&gt;Turn Up The Radio&lt;/strong&gt;, therefore it is not taking place today as previously planned, reported and also confirmed by Live Nation Italia. They are still looking for a product placement deal, especially an automotive deal,  like Madonna did with Smirnoff in Give Me All Your Luvin' video and Jennifer Lopez had with FIAT in her  Papi video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maybe, the video shooting - directed by &lt;strong&gt;Tom Munro&lt;/strong&gt; as we told you a few days ago - will happen next weekend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports by Italian press regarding archeological areas in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt; were not true, in fact a car theme was part of the concept.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content>
	</entry>
