		<author>
			<name>Giampiero Fiorelli</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;EXCLUSIVE - DrownedMadonna.com heard more exclusive news on the &lt;strong&gt;music video&lt;/strong&gt; of &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;'s third single from MDNA, &lt;strong&gt;Turn Up The Radio&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We learned that &lt;strong&gt;Madonna's Turn Up The Radio&lt;/strong&gt; will be directed by famous photographer &lt;strong&gt;Tom Munro&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; already worked with &lt;strong&gt;Munro&lt;/strong&gt; for several magazine shoots and her Give It 2 Me video.&lt;/p&gt;
