	<entry>
		<title>Confirmed: Madonna to shoot the Turn Up the Radio video in Rome on June 10</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/775-confirmed-madonna-to-shoot-the-turn-up-the-radio-video-in-rome-on-june-10.html"/>
		<published>2012-06-06T08:50:06Z</published>
		<updated>2012-06-06T08:50:06Z</updated>
		<id>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/775-confirmed-madonna-to-shoot-the-turn-up-the-radio-video-in-rome-on-june-10.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Giampiero Fiorelli</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;BREAKING NEWS - Italian press is talking about the exclusive news (&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/759-madonnas-turn-up-the-radio-video-to-be-shoot-on-june-10.html&quot;&gt;#1&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/773-update-turn-up-the-radio-to-be-shoot-in-rome-and.html&quot;&gt;#2&lt;/a&gt;) that DrownedMadonna.com published about the &lt;strong&gt;video&lt;/strong&gt; shooting of &lt;strong&gt;Madonna's Turn Up The Radio&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt; on Sunday, June 10.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today Live Nation Italia confirmed our news and also details on a product placement deal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;We are planning a video set in the archeological &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt;,&quot; &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;'s entourage confirmed today to Italian paper La Repubblica.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;'s plans to shoot her video in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt; two days before her concert at the Olympic Stadium are true,&quot; Live Nation Italia Chief, Roberto De Luca, confirms this way our scoop. &lt;strong&gt;Turn Up The Radio video&lt;/strong&gt; is planned to be set on Rome beautiful historical locations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roberto De Luca also confirms our news about a product placement deal that &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; is trying to get, as she did with Smirnoff in Give Me All Your Luvin' video.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
